Conclusion
PathForge demonstrates how a diagnostic-first approach — benchmarking a learner before teaching them — can remove wasted effort from self-directed tech education. By combining an adaptive skill quiz, a pre-crediting roadmap engine, multiple ways to view and act on the same roadmap, and pace-aware planning, the system gives each student a personalised, honest path toward a chosen career track. For this milestone, the complete front-end architecture was built using React, TypeScript and Tailwind CSS, with interactive state management for milestone tracking, Kanban workflow, Pomodoro timers and real-time analytics. The next phase is connecting these interfaces to a cloud database and backend REST API for persistent, cross-device user profiles.
